  "summary": [
    "Separation of publication state and build progress; rebuild-needed and reference-missing are judgments or check results, not states",
    "Confirmed ToC publication states (unbuilt, published) with transitions P-01 to P-03 and a state diagram",
    "ToC build run states and transitions B-01 to B-09, including failure, re-execution, and AI generation only when the backend is ToC",
    "Failure keeps the old confirmed ToC and never publishes the candidate; already confirmed document information is not rolled back",
    "Reference check result categories and freshness: match, path mismatch, missing in directory, with fragment reachability",
    "DLID assignment (embed-dlid) run states E-01 to E-07, including duplicate original confirmation and writes limited to the plan-confirmed stage",
    "doc-db synchronization run states S-01 to S-07, including fallback to ToC on connection failure or embedding failure",
    "Transitions not in the tables are rejected by scripts; search, DLID resolution and checks hold no state"
  ],
